OL,3,GNEWSANurse to lead torch parade after
OL,4,A50 years in job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA torchlit parade will illuminate
OL,7,Fuphill Lincoln later as families
OL,8,Fremember loved ones they have lost.
OL,10,FThe annual event, organised by St
OL,11,FBarnabas Hospice, will be led by Wendy
OL,12,FWetton, who is retiring after 50 years
OL,13,Fin nursing.
OL,15,FThe procession will end at Lincoln
OL,16,FCathedral, where a Christmas Tree of
OL,17,FLife has been put up decorated with
OL,18,Flights ` each dedicated to a person who
OL,19,Fhas passed away.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
