OL,3,GNEWSANurse to lead torch parade after
OL,4,A50 years in job
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Street, who works for the hospice,
OL,7,Fsaid: "It's the symbolism of carrying
OL,8,Fthis physical torch to represent your
OL,9,Floved one. You see the wave of light
OL,10,Fmoving through Lincoln."
